    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">武器(任意)，传奇(需要同调)</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);margin:0.5em 0px;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">这种武器装饰有龙头，爪子，翅膀，鳞片，或龙语文字。它进入巨龙宝库后会吸收龙的吐息武器的能量，并用它的特性造成这种类型的伤害。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);margin:0.5em 0px;min-height:1rem;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:start\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);margin:0.5em 0px;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">当你使用此武器进行攻击检定掷出20时，目标5英尺内每个你选择的生物都受到和龙的吐息武器相同类型的5伤害。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);margin:0.5em 0px;min-height:1rem;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:start\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);margin:0.5em 0px;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;min-height:1rem;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">你使用该武器的攻击检定和伤害掷骰获得+3，每次攻击命中时该武器造成与龙息武器相同类型的额外3d6伤害。</span></p><p></p><p>以一个动作，你可以从武器中释放出 60尺锥形的毁灭性能量。该区域内的每个生物必须进行一次DC 18的敏捷豁免，豁免失败时受到龙息武器造成的12d6伤害，豁免成功时受到的伤害减半。一旦这个动作被使用，直到下一个黎明前它不能再次使用。</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);margin:0.5em 0px;min-height:1rem;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:start\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);margin:0.5em 0px;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">这是一件模板物品，请使用该武器的附魔功能将需要使用的符合要求的武器模板（如长剑，长弓等）完成附魔即可。</span></p>",
